                <note rend="inline" type="source">211.62/67: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-05-16T15:00:00+01:00">May 16, 1929—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received May 16—12:30 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>89. Department’s 33, May 14, 6 p.m. German Government agrees to last of June.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schurman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
